				<p class="hero-description">EmpireCraft started its first season in 2018, and has continued to operate with a tight-knit group that's always welcoming new players. Join players from around the world for collaborative builds, community events, and more.</p>
				<div class="hero-cta">
					<a href="https://discord.gg/AtxJ6JNGTb" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-button cta-primary">Join Discord</a>
					<a href="#server-info" class="cta-button cta-secondary">Learn More</a>
				</div>
