		<div class="container">
			<main>

				<section class="card">
					<h2>Rules and Guidelines</h2>
					<ul>
						<li>Respect your fellow players. No bullying, racism, sexism, homophobia, bigotry, hate speech, or derogatory language of any kind.</li>
						<li>No griefing, stealing, or mean-spirited trolling.</li>
						<li>No cheating, hacking, use of x-ray, or similar actions.</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section class="card" id="server-info">
					<h2>Server Information</h2>
					<div class="server-info">
						<div class="play-now">
							<strong>Play Now:</strong>
							<button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyToClipboard('play.empirecraftmc.com', this)">
								<code>play.empirecraftmc.com</code>
								<span class="copy-icon">📋</span>
							</button>
						</div>
						<p>EmpireCraft is a Java server, meaning you can play on PC, Mac, and Linux. If you are interested in playing on Bedrock (mobile, console, etc.), let us know, and if there's enough interest, we'll consider that for the future.</p>
						<ul>
							<li><strong>Version:</strong> <span id="server-version" class="loading">Loading...</span></li>
							<li><strong>Players Online:</strong> <span id="server-players" class="loading">Loading...</span></li>
							<li><strong>Seed:</strong> 15123566709681618 (please use responsibly)</li>
						</ul>
						<a href="http://map.empirecraftmc.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button">View Server Map</a>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="card whitelist-card">
					<h2>Whitelist Application</h2>
					<div class="discord-dm-notice">
						<strong>⚠️ IMPORTANT:</strong> You must DM your application on Discord to <strong>@Dsman124</strong> or <strong>@Red</strong>
					</div>
					<p>Please answer the following questions and send them via Discord DM:</p>
					<ol>
						<li>What is your username?</li>
						<li>How old are you?</li>
						<li>Where are you from?</li>
						<li>How did you discover this server?</li>
						<li>Why would you like to join?</li>
						<li>What's your favorite movie?</li>
					</ol>
					<a href="https://discord.gg/AtxJ6JNGTb" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button discord" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Open Discord to Apply</a>
				</section>

				<section class="card">
					<h2>Recommended Mods</h2>
					<p>These are optional, but will improve your server experience:</p>
					<ul>
						<li><a href="https://modrinth.com/plugin/simple-voice-chat" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Simple Voice Chat</a></li>
						<li><a href="https://modrinth.com/mod/status" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Status</a></li>
					</ul>
					<p>We also recommend using the <a href="https://prismlauncher.org/download/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Prism Launcher</a></p>
				</section>

				<section class="card">
					<h2>Legacy Server (Season Five)</h2>
					<div class="server-info">
						<div class="play-now">
							<strong>Play Now:</strong>
							<button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyToClipboard('170.205.24.229:25588', this)">
								<code>170.205.24.229:25588</code>
								<span class="copy-icon">📋</span>
							</button>
						</div>
						<ul>
							<li><strong>Version:</strong> <span id="legacy-version" class="loading">Loading...</span></li>
							<li><strong>Players Online:</strong> <span id="legacy-players" class="loading">Loading...</span></li>
							<li><a href="http://oldmap.empirecraftmc.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Server Map</a></li>
						</ul>
						<p class="notice">The legacy server will remain playable until December 6, 2025. At that point, the server will go offline and the world files will be made available shortly after. Thanks!</p>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="card cta">
					<h2>Join the Community</h2>
					<a href="https://discord.gg/AtxJ6JNGTb" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button discord">Join our Discord</a>
					<p style="margin-top: 1rem;">Feel free to invite a friend to play!</p>
				</section>

				<section class="card support">
					<h2>Support EmpireCraft</h2>
					<p>Help keep our server running!</p>
					<a href="https://patreon.com/empirecraftsmp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button patreon">Support on Patreon</a>
				</section>
			</main>

			<footer>
				<p>&copy; 2018-2025 EmpireCraft. All rights reserved.</p>
			</footer>
		</div>

		<!-- Image Modal -->
		<div id="imageModal" class="modal" onclick="closeModal()">
			<span class="modal-close">&times;</span>
			<img class="modal-content" id="modalImage">
		</div>

		<style>
			:root {
				--bg-dark: #0f0f0f;
				--bg-card: #1a1a1a;
				--text-primary: #ffffff;
				--text-secondary: #b0b0b0;
				--accent: #ef5c06;
				--accent-hover: #d94f05;
				--border: #333;
				--discord: #5865F2;
				--patreon: #FF424D;
			}

			* {
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}

			body {
				font-family: 'Stack Sans Headline', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
				background: var(--bg-dark);
				color: var(--text-primary);
				line-height: 1.6;
				min-height: 100vh;
				padding-top: 70px;
				overflow-x: hidden;
			}

			/* Holiday Announcement Bar */
			.announcement-bar {
				position: fixed;
				top: 0;
				left: 0;
				right: 0;
				background: linear-gradient(90deg, #c41e3a 0%, #e63946 50%, #c41e3a 100%);
				color: white;
				text-align: center;
				padding: 0.75rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				font-size: 1rem;
				z-index: 1000;
				box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.5);
				animation: shimmer 3s infinite;
			}

			@keyframes shimmer {
				0%, 100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
				50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
			}

			/* Snowflake Effect */
			.snowflakes {
				position: fixed;
				top: 0;
				left: 0;
				width: 100%;
				height: 100%;
				pointer-events: none;
				z-index: 999;
				overflow: hidden;
			}

			.snowflake {
				position: absolute;
				top: -10%;
				color: #fff;
				font-size: 1.5rem;
				opacity: 0.8;
				animation: fall linear infinite;
				text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
			}

			@keyframes fall {
				to {
					transform: translateY(110vh) rotate(360deg);
				}
			}

			.snowflake:nth-child(1) {
				left: 10%;
				animation-duration: 10s;
				animation-delay: 0s;
				font-size: 1.2rem;
			}

			.snowflake:nth-child(2) {
				left: 20%;
				animation-duration: 12s;
				animation-delay: 1s;
				font-size: 1.8rem;
			}

			.snowflake:nth-child(3) {
				left: 30%;
				animation-duration: 8s;
				animation-delay: 2s;
				font-size: 1rem;
			}

			.snowflake:nth-child(4) {
				left: 40%;
				animation-duration: 14s;
				animation-delay: 0.5s;
				font-size: 1.5rem;
			}

			.snowflake:nth-child(5) {
				left: 50%;
				animation-duration: 11s;
				animation-delay: 1.5s;
				font-size: 1.3rem;
			}

			.snowflake:nth-child(6) {
				left: 60%;
				animation-duration: 9s;
				animation-delay: 3s;
				font-size: 1.6rem;
			}

			.snowflake:nth-child(7) {
				left: 70%;
				animation-duration: 13s;
				animation-delay: 0.8s;
				font-size: 1.1rem;
			}

			.snowflake:nth-child(8) {
				left: 80%;
				animation-duration: 10.5s;
				animation-delay: 2.5s;
				font-size: 1.7rem;
			}

			.snowflake:nth-child(9) {
				left: 90%;
				animation-duration: 11.5s;
				animation-delay: 1.2s;
				font-size: 1.4rem;
			}

			.snowflake:nth-child(10) {
				left: 15%;
				animation-duration: 12.5s;
				animation-delay: 3.5s;
				font-size: 1.2rem;
			}

			.snowflake:nth-child(11) {
				left: 55%;
				animation-duration: 9.5s;
				animation-delay: 2.8s;
				font-size: 1.5rem;
			}

			.snowflake:nth-child(12) {
				left: 75%;
				animation-duration: 10.8s;
				animation-delay: 1.8s;
				font-size: 1.3rem;
			}

			.navbar {
				position: fixed;
				top: 0;
				left: 0;
				right: 0;
				background: var(--bg-card);
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
				z-index: 100;
				backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
				background: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.95);
			}

			.nav-container {
				max-width: 900px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 1rem;
				display: flex;
				justify-content: space-between;
				align-items: center;
			}

			.nav-logo-link {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 0.75rem;
				text-decoration: none;
				transition: opacity 0.2s;
			}

			.nav-logo-link:hover {
				opacity: 0.8;
			}

			.nav-server-icon {
				height: 40px;
				width: 40px;
				border-radius: 50%;
				object-fit: cover;
				border: 2px solid var(--accent);
				box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(239, 92, 6, 0.3);
			}

			.nav-logo-text {
				font-size: 1.3rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: var(--text-primary);
				letter-spacing: -0.5px;
			}

			.nav-links {
				display: flex;
				gap: 2rem;
				align-items: center;
			}

			.nav-link {
				color: var(--text-secondary);
				text-decoration: none;
				font-weight: 500;
				transition: color 0.2s;
				font-size: 0.95rem;
			}

			.nav-link:hover {
				color: var(--accent);
				text-decoration: none;
			}

			.nav-link-support {
				background: var(--accent);
				color: white !important;
				padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
				border-radius: 6px;
				transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
			}

			.nav-link-support:hover {
				background: var(--accent-hover);
				transform: translateY(-1px);
				text-decoration: none !important;
			}

			/* Hero Section with Slideshow */
			.hero {
				position: relative;
				height: 85vh;
				min-height: 600px;
				overflow: hidden;
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
			}

			.slideshow {
				position: absolute;
				top: 0;
				left: 0;
				width: 100%;
				height: 100%;
			}

			.slide {
				position: absolute;
				top: 0;
				left: 0;
				width: 100%;
				height: 100%;
				background-size: cover;
				background-position: center;
				opacity: 0;
				transition: opacity 2s ease-in-out;
			}

			.slide.active {
				opacity: 1;
			}

			.hero-overlay {
				position: absolute;
				top: 0;
				left: 0;
				width: 100%;
				height: 100%;
				background: linear-gradient(
					to bottom,
					rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.7) 0%,
					rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.85) 50%,
					rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.95) 100%
				);
			}

			.hero-content {
				position: relative;
				z-index: 2;
				text-align: center;
				max-width: 900px;
				padding: 2rem;
			}

			.hero-logo {
				max-width: 100%;
				height: auto;
				width: 700px;
				margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
				filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6));
			}

			.hero-tagline {
				color: var(--accent);
				font-size: 1.5rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				margin-bottom: 2rem;
				text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
			}

			.hero-description {
				color: var(--text-primary);
				font-size: 1.1rem;
				line-height: 1.8;
				max-width: 700px;
				margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
				text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
			}

			.hero-cta {
				display: flex;
				gap: 1rem;
				justify-content: center;
				align-items: center;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
			}

			.cta-button {
				padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
				font-size: 1.1rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				text-decoration: none;
				border-radius: 8px;
				transition: all 0.3s ease;
				box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
				display: inline-block;
			}

			.cta-primary {
				background: var(--accent);
				color: white !important;
			}

			.cta-primary:hover {
				background: var(--accent-hover);
				transform: translateY(-3px);
				box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(239, 92, 6, 0.6);
				text-decoration: none !important;
			}

			.cta-secondary {
				background: transparent;
				color: var(--text-primary) !important;
				border: 2px solid var(--text-primary);
			}

			.cta-secondary:hover {
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
				transform: translateY(-3px);
				box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
				text-decoration: none !important;
			}

			.container {
				max-width: 900px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 2rem 1rem;
			}

			/* Modal styles */
			.modal {
				display: none;
				position: fixed;
				z-index: 1000;
				left: 0;
				top: 0;
				width: 100%;
				height: 100%;
				background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
				cursor: pointer;
			}

			.modal-content {
				margin: auto;
				display: block;
				max-width: 90%;
				max-height: 90%;
				position: absolute;
				top: 50%;
				left: 50%;
				transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
				border-radius: 8px;
			}

			.modal-close {
				position: absolute;
				top: 20px;
				right: 35px;
				color: #f1f1f1;
				font-size: 40px;
				font-weight: bold;
				transition: 0.3s;
			}

			.modal-close:hover {
				color: var(--accent);
			}

			.card {
				background: var(--bg-card);
				border: 1px solid var(--border);
				border-radius: 12px;
				padding: 2rem;
				margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
			}

			h2 {
				color: var(--accent);
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
				font-size: 1.5rem;
			}

			ul, ol {
				margin-left: 1.5rem;
				margin-top: 0.5rem;
			}

			li {
				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
				color: var(--text-secondary);
			}

			p {
				color: var(--text-secondary);
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}

			a {
				color: var(--accent);
				text-decoration: none;
				transition: color 0.2s, text-decoration 0.2s;
			}

			a:hover {
				color: var(--accent-hover);
				text-decoration: underline;
			}

			.button {
				display: inline-block;
				padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
				background: var(--accent);
				color: white !important;
				border-radius: 8px;
				text-decoration: none !important;
				font-weight: 600;
				transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.2s;
				margin-top: 0.5rem;
				box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
			}

			.button:hover {
				background: var(--accent-hover);
				text-decoration: none !important;
				transform: translateY(-2px);
				box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(239, 92, 6, 0.4);
			}

			.button.discord {
				background: var(--discord);
				color: white !important;
			}

			.button.discord:hover {
				background: #4752C4;
				text-decoration: none !important;
				box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(88, 101, 242, 0.4);
			}

			.button.patreon {
				background: var(--patreon);
				color: white !important;
			}

			.button.patreon:hover {
				background: #E03A44;
				text-decoration: none !important;
				box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(255, 66, 77, 0.4);
			}

			.server-info {
				margin-top: 1rem;
			}

			.play-now {
				background: var(--bg-dark);
				padding: 1rem;
				border-radius: 8px;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
				border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
			}

			.play-now strong {
				color: var(--text-primary);
			}

			code {
				background: var(--bg-dark);
				padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
				border-radius: 4px;
				color: var(--accent);
				font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
				display: inline-block;
				margin-left: 0.5rem;
				font-size: 1.1rem;
			}

			.notice {
				background: var(--bg-dark);
				padding: 1rem;
				border-radius: 8px;
				border-left: 4px solid #ff9800;
				margin-top: 1rem;
			}

			.cta, .support {
				text-align: center;
			}

			.discord-dm-notice {
				background: var(--bg-dark);
				padding: 1rem;
				border-radius: 8px;
				border-left: 4px solid var(--discord);
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}

			.discord-dm-notice strong {
				color: var(--discord);
			}

			.copy-btn {
				background: none;
				border: none;
				padding: 0;
				cursor: pointer;
				display: inline-flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 0.5rem;
				transition: opacity 0.2s;
			}

			.copy-btn:hover {
				opacity: 0.8;
			}

			.copy-btn code {
				margin-left: 0;
			}

			.copy-icon {
				font-size: 1.2rem;
				transition: transform 0.2s;
			}

			.copy-btn:hover .copy-icon {
				transform: scale(1.1);
			}

			.copy-btn.copied .copy-icon {
				animation: pulse 0.3s ease;
			}

			@keyframes pulse {
				0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
				50% { transform: scale(1.3); }
			}

			.loading {
				color: var(--text-secondary);
				opacity: 0.6;
				font-style: italic;
			}

			.server-status-online {
				color: #4CAF50;
			}

			.server-status-offline {
				color: #f44336;
			}

			footer {
				text-align: center;
				color: var(--text-secondary);
				padding: 2rem 0;
				margin-top: 2rem;
				border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
			}

			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.hero {
					height: 70vh;
					min-height: 500px;
				}

				.hero-logo {
					width: 90%;
				}

